/**
 * Phase 1 dummy content. Typed as Fact[], so a shape mistake is a compile
 * error rather than a runtime surprise.
 *
 * The first facts match the design PDF exactly.
 *
 * Images are PLACEHOLDERS from picsum.photos, present only so the photo-card
 * variant renders during phase 1. They are unrelated stock photographs, not
 * pictures of the things described, and every one must be replaced with a
 * real open-licence image before launch. We never ship AI imagery of real
 * artifacts, people or places, so these stay generic rather than illustrative.
 *
 * The photo credit and licence still travel with each one, because a card
 * that can drop a credit in phase 1 will drop one in phase 2.
 */

